<title>FINLAND: Finnair Nov passenger load factor rises.</title>
<headline>Finnair Nov passenger load factor rises.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish national airline Finnair Oy said in a statement on Friday its passenger load factor rose 2.0 percentage points year-on-year in November to 66.4 percent.  </p>
<p>Finnair gave the following statistics:</p>
<p>					Nov 1996    Oct 1996   Yr/yr(pct)</p>
<p> Passengers (thousand)	     504	   547	  +4.9</p>
<p> RPK (million)			 901	   881	  +7.4</p>
<p> RTK (million)			 107	   102	 +13.2</p>
<p> Cargo and mail (thousand kg)  5,420	 5,195	  +3.4</p>
<p> Passenger load factor (pct)    66.4	  65.1	  +2.0 pts</p>
<p>November 1996 totals broken down by flight type:</p>
<p>			Passengers   RPK	 RTK	    Cargo</p>
<p>			thousand   million    million     thousand kg</p>
<p> International	 273	 678	  87	    4,830</p>
<p> Domestic		200	  88	   8		482</p>
<p> Charter		  31	 135	  13		109</p>
<p>Load factor (percent) by flight type:</p>
<p>				  Nov 1996   Oct 1996  Yr/yr (pct pts)</p>
<p> International		  66.3	 62.7	  +2.2</p>
<p> Domestic			 54.5	 54.3	  +1.3</p>
<p>Finnair's financial year runs from April 1 to March 31. @</p>
<p>RPK - revenue passenger km (revenue passengers carried multiplied by km flown)</p>
<p>RTK - revenue tonne km (tonnage of revenue load carried -- passengers, cargo and mail -- multiplied by km flown.</p>
<p>Passenger load factor - RPK as a percentage of available seat km</p>
<p>Finnair does not give a cargo load factor.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 235</p>
</text>
